{{JPExclusive}}
'''Sora & Cat''' is a [[:Category:Special Cats|Special Cat]] that can be unlocked from the [[Catnip Challenges]] during the [[Kaohsiung Rapid Transit Collaboration Event]]. She was added in [[Version 11.1 Update|Version 11.1]].

{{Cat Info
|ID = 637
|rarity = EX
|name1 = Sora & Cat
|name2 = Sora & Cat CC
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Sora & Cat CC''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
Despite a 100% chance to freeze [[:Category:Red Enemies|Red]] enemies, Sora & Cat fails as a spammable crowd-controller due to poor stats, a terrible Freeze uptime, and Single-Target attacks. Even worse, her niche causes her to face competition with [[Apple Cat (Super Rare Cat)|iCat]], which has significantly more health, a lower recharge time, way better uptime, and Area Attack. Even if one doesn't have iCat, however, she still gets outclassed by cheaper, more reliable control options like [[Witch Cat (Rare Cat)|Witch Cat]] and [[Pirate Cat (Rare Cat)|Pirate Cat]], leaving no real reason to use her beyond User Rank.

{{Job|Classification = Crowd-Controller}}

